and engineering partner for scale-ups and enterprise products.", "facets": []}, "location": "", "banner_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1566851334283870210/1786803935", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2097100069376028672/trgGfghP_200x200.jpg", "joined": "Mon Sep 05 18:11:41 +0000 2022", "protected": false, "website": {"url": "http://kargul.studio", "display_url": "kargul.studio"}, "verification": {"verified": true, "verified_at": null, "type": "individual"}, "type": "profile"}, "replies": 25, "reposts": 4, "likes": 172, "bookmarks": 100, "quotes": 1, "embed_card": "summary_large_image", "created_at": "Thu Jul 09 19:37:19 +0000 2026", "created_timestamp": 1783625839, "possibly_sensitive": false, "views": 44172, "is_note_tweet": false, "community_note": null, "lang": "en", "replying_to": null, "media": {"all": [{"type": "photo", "id": "2075303033873768448", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HMz1HSdWIAA3k8x.jpg?name=orig", "width": 864, "height": 1027}], "photos": [{"type": "photo", "id": "2075303033873768448", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HMz1HSdWIAA3k8x.jpg?name=orig", "width": 864, "height": 1027}]}, "quote": {"type": "status", "url": "https://x.com/galshirart/status/2074854464729629060", "id": "2074854464729629060", "text": "It\u2019s over. I\u2019m quitting design.\n \nA client of mine just created a logo with Fable 5, and the result left me speechless.\n \nIt understood the brand story, values, audience, strategy, and turned all of it into a smart, minimal symbol. A genuinely brilliant concept. The kind of idea that captures everything at once. Something I honestly don\u2019t think I would have come up with myself.\n \nAnd it didn\u2019t just nail the idea. It executed the design pixel-perfectly.\n \nSo I raise the white flag.\n\nMy skepticism about AI\u2019s ability to do great design is officially gone.\n\nThere, I said it:\n\nAI beat me at design.\n\nNow that AI finally took my job, I can peacefully quit and dedicate my life to studying the only thing it may never achieve: human consciousness and the pathways to God.\n\nGood luck everyone.", "raw_text": {"text": "It\u2019s over. I\u2019m quitting design.\n \nA client of mine just created a logo with Fable 5, and the result left me speechless.\n \nIt understood the brand story, values, audience, strategy, and turned all of it into a smart, minimal symbol. A genuinely brilliant concept. The kind of idea that captures everything at once. Something I honestly don\u2019t think I would have come up with myself.\n \nAnd it didn\u2019t just nail the idea. It executed the design pixel-perfectly.\n \nSo I raise the white flag.\n\nMy skepticism about AI\u2019s ability to do great design is officially gone.\n\nThere, I said it:\n\nAI beat me at design.\n\nNow that AI finally took my job, I can peacefully quit and dedicate my life to studying the only thing it may never achieve: human consciousness and the pathways to God.\n\nGood luck everyone.", "display_text_range": [0, 792], "facets": [{"type": "bold", "indices": [579, 600]}]}, "author": {"screen_name": "galshirart", "url": "https://x.com/galshirart", "id": "2438767100", "followers": 112086, "following": 750, "likes": 23849, "media_count": 980, "statuses": 3888, "name": "Gal Shir", "description": "Retired designer (AI took my job)\nNow making art and studying human consciousness\n\n\u2014 Previously @Lemonade_Inc\n\u2014 Founder http://ColorHunt.co", "raw_description": {"text": "Retired designer (AI took my job)\nNow making art and studying human consciousness\n\n\u2014 Previously @Lemonade_Inc\n\u2014 Founder https://t.co/uImZ0zWUu5", "facets": [{"type": "url", "indices": [120, 143], "original": "https://t.co/uImZ0zWUu5", "replacement": "http://ColorHunt.co", "display": "ColorHunt.co"}]}, "location": "Tel Aviv", "banner_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/2438767100/1696280737", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1684291552842055682/R-y5tqGS_200x200.jpg", "joine